flowchart LR
    A[Text image audio or video] --> B{Can the model receive it?}
    B -->|No| C[Provide an accessible alternative]
    B -->|Yes| D{Is the content clear and complete?}
    D -->|No| E[Improve or transcribe the input]
    D -->|Yes| F[Check accessibility]
    C --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G[Check source and interpretation]
    G --> H[Use with appropriate human review]